<p>Hi <%= @interviewer&.full_name %>,</p>

<p><%= @reminder ? "A reminder: we still need your feedback on the candidate you interviewed." : "Please share your feedback on the candidate you interviewed." %></p>

<table cellpadding="6" style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;">
  <tr><td style="color:#666;">Candidate</td><td><strong><%= @candidate.name %></strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td style="color:#666;">Interview</td><td><%= @when_text %></td></tr>
</table>

<%= mail_button "Give your feedback", @feedback_url %>

<p>It takes a few minutes — ratings for technical skills, communication, problem solving and culture fit, your strengths and concerns, an overall rating and your decision.</p>

<p>You can also fill it in after signing in, under <a href="<%= @my_interviews_url %>">Interviews → My interviews</a>.</p>

<p style="color:#666;font-size:12px;">This link is personal to you, so please don&rsquo;t forward it. No login is needed.</p>
